  "description": "Yuria, a succubus, heads to her regular bar to find her partner for one night, but for some reason, she cannot find the person in her heart today. In front of Yuria, who was forced to turn around, a human man appears who perfectly suits his taste. Yuria follows him as if possessed by the mysterious energy exuding from the man, and his body heats up at the thought of consuming the highest energy for the first time in a long time. Just as they are about to lay a man on the bed and kiss him, a chain protruding from somewhere restrains Yuria's entire body..\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/sjango)\n\n**Official Translations:**    \n[Japanese](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/sjango)",
